Hi,

Our next Open Printing call will be *this* Wednesday on 14 November.

Minutes from our last OP call are archived at:

  ftp://ftp.pwg.org/pub/pwg/openprinting/minutes/OP-Minutes-20121010.htm

Agenda:

(1) Printing News (Till K, others)

(2) Status of Common Mobile Print Client (Glen P)

(3) Status of Lightweight Print Client (Glen P)

(4) Other status? (all)

(5) OP Future Directions (all)
- Cloud Print (multi-domain issues, document content privacy)
- Multifunction Services (scan, fax, etc.)
- Lightweight Transform Service
- Lightweight Print Service (for mobile and other small devices)
- LSB 5.0

(6) PWG highlights for Open Printing (Ira M, Glen P)
* PWG F2F Meeting on 5-6 December 2012 in Irvine, CA (Samsung)
* IPP Everywhere project
-- IPP Everywhere (profile) - PWG Formal Vote in December 2012
-- IPPS URI Scheme - sent to IETF Apps ADs on 12 November 2012
-- LDAP Printer Schema - updated version soon in November 2012
-- Media Standardized Names v2 - PWG Last Call in December 2012
* IPP Multifunction project
-- in progress throughout 2013
* Cloud Imaging WG
-- Cloud Print Model - Prototype draft in Q2 2013
* SM WG
-- Mapping of PWG Print Job Ticket (moved from Cloud WG)
-- Transform Service - Prototype draft in Q2 2013
* CWMP BOF
-- SOHO Print Model to be proposed to BBF in Q1 2013


Dial-in information:

November 2012 - US/Europe - OP Monthly Meeting
    - Note - European Summer Time ended on Sunday 28 October 2012
    - Note - US Daylight Savings Time ended on Sunday 4 November 2012

    - Wednesday 14 November 2012, Daytime
      - US
        9am in San Francisco - US PST (Pacific Standard Time)
        10am in Colorado - US MST (Mountain Standard Time)
        11am in Chicago - US CST (Central Standard Time)
        12pm in New York - US EST (Eastern Standard Time)
      - Europe
        6pm in Berlin - CET (Central European Time)

    * Main Number (Till Kamppeter, LF, leader)
      International: +1-218-936-7999
      Access Code:   491659#

Cheers,
- Ira

